            "review_title": "Review at Paulie's Pizza & Pasta",
            "review_text": "Antonio E L\n4 contributions\n0\nExcellent Italian style spaghetti dishes\nMar 2026 • Couples\nAfter 20 days tasting the excellent Vietnamese food, the last night we fancied some Italian spaghetti and we found this restaurant with pasta Mediterranean style that gave us some spaghetti Agli e Olio and another Fruti di Mare very good. We recommend it.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Spanish\nShow original\nWritten April 14, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
