            "review_text": "billyperu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nOne of my favourite restaurants in Tan Binh\nJul 2020 • Solo\nThe food here is excellent. Lots of options whether you want burgers, pizza or wraps. I had a Irish breakfast on sourdough this morning that I'm still smiling about. If you're staying near the airport I highly recommend dropping in. Home deliver also available.\n\nPS the potato wedges are delicious too🥔👍\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 4, 2020",
